core.js in this directory is vendored, unmodified apart from a prepended credit comment,
from Sakuga VFX at commit c3dabb173928a3ad2372183103caf2e6f50953d0.

    https://github.com/finktheartist/sakuga-vfx

It is a static asset served from this app's own origin. It is not an npm dependency: the
runtime dependencies stay exactly react, react-dom and idb.

